      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-02-17T06:43:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we can do this check here. NsdManager is in app space. So two NsdManagers in different processes could both attempt to register for interface 42, and this check would not fail because they\u0027re in different processes.",
