        "id": 1758351
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-02-22T06:13:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the IllegalArgument should be accurate here. The logic here is checking one engine object cannot be registered for two interface. If the engine object already registered for some interface it should not be reused. Therefore, we throw IllegalArgument.",
      "parentUuid": "9b03f71f_01cab363",
      "range": {
