        "id": 1000835
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-02-17T06:43:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looks like this API can offload services, which are... PTR queries? What about the other queries used in MDNS, such as SRV, A, AAAA? Can this object support those? Or perhaps it doesn\u0027t need to?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 34,
        "startChar": 25,
        "endLine": 34,
        "endChar": 37
      },
      "revId": "e9d86080b5d30d6f31cb4a717a7d60a52f902f61",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b928e9fd_a2e5282e",
        "filename": "framework-t/src/android/net/nsd/OffloadInfo.java",
