      "lineNbr": 34,
      "author": {
        "id": 1758351
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-02-22T06:13:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks. Lets look at an example as follows:\nServiceName: test_service\nServiceType: _mnt._tcp.\nHostName: Android.local\n\nWe can feed the following QNAME into ApfFilter\n1. _mnt._tcp.local for PTR record query\n2. test_service._mnt._tcp.local for SRV/TXT record query\n3. Android.local for A/AAAA record query",
      "parentUuid": "80255a56_2216ff48",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 34,
        "startChar": 25,
        "endLine": 34,
        "endChar": 37
      },
